  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Premium leather has a supple finish and a slight sheen\nSleek low profile with lightly padded tongue and collar\nSignature Swoosh branding\nMulti-colored design for bold style\nSecure lace closure for a locked-in fit\nPadded midsole provides cushioned comfort\nPatterned rubber cupsole construction for elevated traction and grip\nThe Nike Dunk Low SE is imported.\nBack and better than ever, the Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes are a modern-day must-have rooted in tradition. Inspired by throwback hoops sneakers but featuring contemporary design details and materials, these sneakers are a daily wardrobe staple.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sail/Light Orewood Brown/Sail/Linen</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3338098</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Co